<h5 data-zesty-id="content:text:37:59">Register to Ring | Volunteers &amp; Group Leaders!</h5>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:38:25">
	We’re so excited you've decided to volunteer on behalf of The Salvation Army’s Red Kettle Campaign. Register to Ring will help you find the perfect time and place to ring bells. Find the time and place that best fits your busy schedule to volunteer to ring.&nbsp;
</p>
